Install se pehle (aaj ya kal, ngrok ki website par):

Authtoken reset karein. Purana token ek chat mein paste ho chuka tha. dashboard.ngrok.com → Your Authtoken → Reset. Naya token kahin likh lein, lekin kisi chat mein paste na karein.
Hobbyist plan lein. Free plan 400 dials roz ke liye kaafi nahi.
Aap ka static domain lumpiness-alienate-coveting.ngrok-free.dev ek waqt mein sirf ek computer par chal sakta hai. Office PC par ngrok chal raha ho to use band karein.

MacBook par install (Terminal mein):

curl -sSL https://ngrok-agent.s3.amazonaws.com/ngrok.asc | sudo tee /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d/ngrok.asc >/dev/null
echo "deb https://ngrok-agent.s3.amazonaws.com buster main" | sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/ngrok.list
sudo apt update && sudo apt install ngrok
ngrok version

Phir naya token add karein (NAYA_TOKEN ki jagah apna token):

ngrok config add-authtoken NAYA_TOKEN
